OL,3,GNEWSANine women paid compensation over
OL,4,Apolice abuse claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine women have been paid compensation
OL,7,Ffollowing claims a police force failed
OL,8,Fto investigate serving and former
OL,9,Fofficers for domestic abuse and sexual
OL,10,Fviolence.
OL,12,FThe women say they were not taken
OL,13,Fseriously when they reported alleged
OL,14,Fcases of rape, assault and coercive
OL,15,Fcontrol by male officers employed by
OL,16,FDevon and Cornwall Police.
OL,18,FOne woman described the force as a "big
OL,19,Fboys' club" which had "protected" the
OL,20,Fman who she claims assaulted her.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
