OL,3,GNEWSANine women paid compensation over
OL,4,Apolice abuse claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force has apologised to the women
OL,7,Fand agreed an out-of-court settlement
OL,8,Fto pay compensation without admitting
OL,9,Flegal liability.
